  }, "4Q: Began dismantling the monorepo (ongoing)")), mdx("p", null, "Throughout the year, I only removed incorrect code couplings. I barely contributed to the service and mostly cleared technical debt. Despite the hard work, the results were unsatisfactory. Declaring last year as a career high turned out to be a jinx."), mdx("p", null, "In 4Q, I spent countless hours catching errors and preparing to separate the codebase by removing tacit knowledge and debts that had been with the product since before I joined. I hope to see the fruits of this labor next year."), mdx("p", null, "This year was the most extreme in my career, with incredibly high stress."), mdx("ul", null, mdx("li", {
